id: pm-sn3xor
title: "GH-871: preserve letter-suffixed issue codes in duplicate similarity scoring"
description: The similarity scorer truncates complete codes such as BD-30-A through BD-30-D to BD-30 and assigns distinct sibling work a 0.99 issue_code duplicate score with unsafe close guidance. Extract full letter/task suffixes and reserve the near-certain score for exact complete-code equality.
